ass=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">对峙；对抗；面对；直面；遭遇</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"93048\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はかってその<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>直面<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょくめん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她曾一度面临这一问题。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">著書</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちょしょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">著作；作品；著述</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"100209\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>物理学<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶつりがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>著書<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>出版<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅっぱん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他有一本关于物理学的书被出版了。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/801917\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">貯蓄</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちょちく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">储蓄；储钱</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195676\">まさかのときに<ruby>備<rp>(</rp><rt>そな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えて<ruby>貯蓄<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょちく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">留些东西给雨天</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">直感</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちょっかん</span></div><