">塵取り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちりとり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">簸箕；撮子</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">治療</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちりょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（医学）治疗；护理；疗法；治愈；补救</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"150176\"><ruby>治療<rp>(</rp><rt>ちりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よりも<ruby>予防<rp>(</rp><rt>よぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">防胜于治。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/9968913\" title=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">賃金</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちんぎん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">工资；薪金；薪水；租金；租赁费</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110243\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はわたしらに<ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ない<ruby>賃金<rp>(</rp><rt>ちんぎん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しかくれなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他给了我们下流的工资</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">沈殿</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちんでん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">沉淀；析出；沉降</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">沈没</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちんぼつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">沉没；下沉；浸没；烂醉；酩酊大醉；沉湎；贪恋（尤指在风月场所等）而荒废工作；长期逗留；在一个地方待很久</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96527\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>沈没<rp>(</rp><rt>ちんぼつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>船<rp>(</rp><rt>ふね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見捨<rp>(</rp><rt>みす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们抛弃了沉船</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">沈黙</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちんもく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">沉默；寂静；安静；沉默寡言；不作为</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205915\">それから<ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>沈黙<rp>(</rp><rt>ちんもく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>続<rp>(</rp><rt>つづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在那之后,长时间的沉默。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">陳列</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ちんれつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">展览；陈列；展示</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225842\">キャビネットは<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めたものを<ruby>陳列<rp>(</rp><rt>ちんれつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するための<ruby>食器棚<rp>(</rp><rt>しょっきだな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">柜子是用来展示东西的橱柜</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">チームワーク</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">团队合作；团队配合</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79652\"><ruby>野球<rp>(</rp><rt>やきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>最<rp>(</rp><rt>もっと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もすばらしいところはチームワークだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">棒球最美妙的就是团队合作</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">追及</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついきゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">追查；审问；追问；逼问；追上；赶上；超越</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125699\"><ruby>追及<rp>(</rp><rt>ついきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されて、つい、<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>え<ruby>透<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた<ruby>嘘<rp>(</rp><rt>うそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をついてしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我被他们的质问所逼迫 并溜进了一个明显的谎言。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">追跡</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついせき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">追逐；追捕；跟踪；尾随；追溯；追查</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211193\">その<ruby>警官<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>泥棒<rp>(</rp><rt>どろぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>追跡<rp>(</rp><rt>ついせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">警察追着小偷</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">次いで</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついで</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">其次；接着；随后</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205271\">それは<ruby>教育<rp>(</rp><rt>きょういく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>次<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いで<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きな<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是教育方面的主要问题。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">追放</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついほう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">流放；放逐；驱逐；遣送；清洗；开除；罢免；消除；排除（如消除贫困）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168217\"><ruby>支配者<rp>(</rp><rt>しはいしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>打倒<rp>(</rp><rt>だとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>され<ruby>国外<rp>(</rp><rt>こくがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>追放<rp>(</rp><rt>ついほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">统治者被推翻并驱逐出境。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">費やす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ついやす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">花费；支出；消耗；浪费；挥霍；浪掷；投入；奉献</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202547\">つまらないことに<ruby>時間<rp>(</rp><rt>じかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>費<rp>(</rp><rt>つい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>やすな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">别浪费你的时间在小事上</span></div></li>"]